  "title": "Avoid over-Relying on One Tool or Method",
  "description": "Avoid over-relying on one tool or method. Train yourself to explore alternatives: - Ask ‘What’s missing?’: Think about other tools or methods that could help solve the problem. - Experiment: Try a new approach, even if your favorite tool seems like it’ll work fine. - Learn alternatives: Regularly update your skills and knowledge about other methods or tools. Example: If you always use Excel for data, try a visualization tool like Power BI or a programming language like Python.",
